---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: '#fff'
    primaryTextColor: '#000'
    primaryBorderColor: '#000'
    lineColor: '#000'
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CaptureModule
    participant ParserModule
    participant ReasoningModule
    participant VulnAnalysisModule
    participant ExploitationModule
    participant ReportingModule
    participant DataStore

    User->>CaptureModule: Start capture (+scope)
    CaptureModule-->>DataStore: Save HAR file
    CaptureModule-->>ParserModule: HAR file

    ParserModule-->>ReasoningModule: Endpoint list (structured JSON)
    ReasoningModule-->>VulnAnalysisModule: Test cases (endpoint + payloads)

    loop each test case
        VulnAnalysisModule-->>ExploitationModule: Suspected vuln + PoC
        ExploitationModule-->>VulnAnalysisModule: Result (OK / FP)
    end

    VulnAnalysisModule-->>ReportingModule: Vulnerability findings + evidence
    ExploitationModule-->>ReportingModule: Additional PoC evidence (req/res, screenshot)
    ReportingModule-->>DataStore: Save report (text/HTML/PDF, CVSS)
    ReportingModule-->>User: Final report (download link / e-mail)